## Description

 This function demonstrates various link types. See [`simple`](x-r-help:simple) for a simpler example. Also see [`stats::lm`](x-r-help:stats/lm) for linear models. 

## Usage

```r
with_links(data)
```

## Arguments

::: {.list-table header-rows=1}

- - Argument
  - Description

- - `data`
  - A data frame. See [`base::data.frame`](x-r-help:base/data.frame).

:::

## See Also

[`simple`](x-r-help:simple), [`ggplot2::ggplot`](x-r-help:ggplot2/ggplot)

## Examples

```{r}
with_links(mtcars)
```
